@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@empresaId = emp-alpha-uuid-0001

### 1. Importar CSV
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/banking/importar/csv?empresaId={{empresaId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="teste_extrato.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./teste_extrato.csv
------boundary--

### 2. Listar lançamentos pendentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/banking/extrato/{{empresaId}}/pendentes

### 3. Listar contas a receber pendentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/banking/contas-receber/{{empresaId}}/pendentes

### 4. Conciliar (troque os IDs pelos que vierem das requisições 2 e 3 acima)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/banking/conciliar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "extratoLancamentoId": "8459e21b-d3eb-4c19-9900-566405ca4526",
  "contaReceberId": "18fb70b2-759e-48c7-bf31-6ac571489060",
  "usuarioId": "algum-uuid-de-usuario",
  "observacao": "teste manual via REST Client"
}

### 5. Importar OFX
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/banking/importar/ofx?empresaId={{empresaId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary2

------boundary2
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="teste_extrato.ofx"
Content-Type: application/x-ofx

< ./teste_extrato.ofx
------boundary2--

### 6. Verificar campos da Empresa
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/empresas

### 7. Testar login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "22233344455",
  "senha": "123456"
}
